# Never upload secrets or plaintext logins with a CLI deploy (audit round 2).
# `npx vercel` uploads the working tree and reads only THIS file plus its own
# short default list (which covers .env.local and .env.*.local, nothing
# else) — .gitignore does not apply. So the secret ignores are repeated here.
# backups/ holds buyer exports and import plans with plaintext passwords; the
# env files and service-account JSON hold server secrets (Vercel has its own
# env vars, so the build never needs them). Mirrors .gitignore.
backups/
.env*
*sa*.json
*service-account*.json
*-credentials.json
pipeline/.env
pipeline/.venv/
